tetimestamp": 1785894911}, {"pid": 877455587, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 78, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 09:56", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "相比起这些高位的套利<br/>其实低位那些一直在涨啊  是一直啊。。。。。。。。。。。。。。。。<br/>那些都不能吸引一点你们的目光嘛", "lou": 82, "content_length": 112, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785894968}, {"pid": 877456786, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 76, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:05", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877456255,47288722,212]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60925933]ywlight2468[/uid] (2026-08-05 10:01):[/b]<br/><br/>做惯了科技的股民，那些杂毛哪里还能有刺激。[/quote]<br/>杂毛？<br/>到时候别叫喳喳说要来就行了<br/>下半年的主线我TM上半年就精准定位给你们。没有人比我看得更远。", "lou": 83, "content_length": 97, "reply_to": 877456255, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785895522}, {"pid": 877457241, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 76, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:09", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "那种打架的就别去了  我也是服你们了  对于你们来说  那种级别的打架就像蚂蚁在象群中间找屎吃。", "lou": 84, "content_length": 84, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785895759}, {"pid": 877459183, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 61, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:23", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877458238,47288722,216]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60262240]nerugigannte[/uid] (2026-08-05 10:16):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大今天光是差不多结束了吗。<br/>早上有底仓有胆量敢吃血筹不恋战的，这会已经人均十个点套利出去拉别的了，今天只要不砸到开盘价都是赚的吧[/quote]<br/>噢？这个时候你们又不算底仓的亏损了？", "lou": 85, "content_length": 41, "reply_to": 877458238, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785896584}, {"pid": 877459650, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 82, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:26", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "按成交量来说  大多数科技死忠被套在光里了  而且在不断放量拼杀<br/>那打个时间差 <br/>科技+券商放量涨起来  就是吃完筹码  机构想开启4-4了  <br/>不一定能成，至少今天是第一次尝试。<br/>这波3800套利上面的成本估计做出来了。", "lou": 86, "content_length": 184, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785896801}, {"pid": 877459830, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 59, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:28", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877459455,47288722,218]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=17896699]川岳山河[/uid] (2026-08-05 10:25):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大黄金有突破的趋势了，下半年能先走波贵金属的修复么[/quote]<br/>我都说了4000附近买黄金期货多单<br/>下去每100加一次  不跌就不买  涨了就拿着<br/>我的策略都是持续的 不是一天变一次的  不要多问我了 <br/>我不看好行情我买多单做什么。<br/>我只是不买黄金股而已。", "lou": 87, "content_length": 166, "reply_to": 877459455, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785896889}, {"pid": 877460571, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 49, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:33", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877460210,47288722,219]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=14202967]莫二先生[/uid] (2026-08-05 10:31):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大的意思是这一轮少不了券商，甚至可能是打火机？[/quote]<br/>就非要做券商？我反正只看不买 这种脏东西我不碰的。", "lou": 88, "content_length": 53, "reply_to": 877460210, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785897222}, {"pid": 877461128, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 118, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:37", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我和你们说一个现实<br/>首先 这里是2WE-2.5WE对不对  相比之前4000点的3WE以上是不是量能不足的 而且两融跑了3000多E 这些钱也是要回来的<br/>好了 我问你  已知这个量能只能支撑一个高位板块的主反<br/>国产半导体和 海外光是竞争这些资金的关系<br/><br/>在目前大光有利空的情况下  做国产半导体的会不会顺势踩一脚？<br/>你们想想你们的职场生活。", "lou": 89, "content_length": 285, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785897465}, {"pid": 877461277, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 64, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:38", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877460970,47288722,220]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=1097334]zxl9547[/uid] (2026-08-05 10:36):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，今天踏空感严重啊，这半个月一直20%仓位在玩，昨天没敢加仓位，今天更不敢了[s:ac:晕][/quote]<br/>我不是说么 这里就是打个时间差  你在  怕了---不怕  这个阶段 就是拉起来让你没机会的阶段<br/>机构做得很成功的 <br/>我这几天都在说这个事。 你就是例子。", "lou": 90, "content_length": 132, "reply_to": 877460970, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785897521}, {"pid": 877461803, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 64, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:42", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877461431,47288722,221]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67265639]柚子asd[/uid] (2026-08-05 10:39):[/b]<br/><br/>怪不得这边国产半导体要拉，这边是要体现品德高尚的时刻是吗？后面要调整跟着隔壁调整就行了？[/quote]<br/>跟高尚品德没关系。。。。<br/>说不定今晚继续出光的小作文 就是半导体这边的人丢出来的。", "lou": 91, "content_length": 83, "reply_to": 877461431, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785897756}, {"pid": 877462062, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 50, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:44", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877461919,47288722,222]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67138111]Altyport[/uid] (2026-08-05 10:43):[/b]<br/><br/>竞争关系，存量市场抢资金抢资源[/quote]<br/>我说个粗鄙的话<br/>趁他病要他命", "lou": 92, "content_length": 31, "reply_to": 877461919, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785897877}, {"pid": 877462519, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 175, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:48", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我没什么操作了 <br/>这波能给你们的都给了  接下来就看你们自己的了  我能救赎的已经做到位了  我也不是圣人 至少目前毫无打算<br/><br/>等到4-4顶部 如果我不忙的时候我会说多一点  剩下这里的时间以聊天为主。", "lou": 93, "content_length": 171, "14": {"12": 1}, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785898082}, {"pid": 877462769, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 39, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:49", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877462549,47288722,223]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67198839]cookingvi[/uid] (2026-08-05 10:48):[/b]<br/><br/>为什么长鑫被猛踩啊[/quote]<br/>他一个次新 又没有暴跌  你觉得他现在走修复行情嘛？修复到哪里去？", "lou": 94, "content_length": 65, "reply_to": 877462549, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785898194}, {"pid": 877463252, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 72, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:53", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877463078,47288722,224]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67203513]杰尼龟龟龟zzZ[/uid] (2026-08-05 10:52):[/b]<br/><br/>不是说还有c杀吗[/quote]<br/>怎么了 有C杀我就不能做B反嘛？<br/>相比红利一个月10%的波动   半导体几天50%的波动不香嘛", "lou": 95, "content_length": 81, "reply_to": 877463078, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785898392}, {"pid": 877463487, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 28, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:55", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877463217,47288722,225]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=66056898]行云式[/uid] (2026-08-05 10:52):[/b]<br/><br/>这里有个非常有意思的事情，黄金计提了这么多次加息预期，而且美债利率高企等等这么大的利空，还这么强势。资金预判黄金接下来可能有一段上涨趋势，反应到盘面上就是黄金股提前抢跑走了好长一段趋势。这里不是建议，我不参与黄金股的。[/quote]<br/>等川普石油合同保护期到  黄金就能涨了<br/>也能降息了 <br/>算了 这个可能和你们解释不清楚  大概就是这个意思。", "lou": 96, "content_length": 95, "reply_to": 877463217, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785898515}, {"pid": 877464088, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 107, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:59", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "我和你们说一下  B反是一次性的 不管是科技的B反  还是指数的4-4 都是一次性的<br/>因为大资金预期后面还会跌一次  或者跌一下  <br/>这里要信早信，但是如果在这波的顶部才进场。那就真是等死了。", "lou": 97, "content_length": 163, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785898776}, {"pid": 877464768, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 61, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 11:04", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877464544,47288722,227]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67142257]兰斯洛t[/uid] (2026-08-05 11:03):[/b]<br/><br/>60分线现出有效突破 日级别水下金叉 4-4开启不会是来真的吧[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>不是我说 你看别的人敢盘中和之前这么确定性的和你说这些东西嘛[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 98, "content_length": 61, "reply_to": 877464544, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785899081}, {"pid": 877465434, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 63, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 11:09", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "而且你们发现了没  哪怕是半导体反弹  材料的反弹幅度也大于设备幅度[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 99, "content_length": 58, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1785899360}], "__T": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "topic_misc": "AgLQUfU", "subject": "自立自强，科学技术打头阵----救赎版", "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 134283264, "replies": 35762, "authorid": 150058, "postdate": 1785481814, "lastpost": 1788164726, "jdata": null, "author": "-阿狼-", "lastposter": "哇考考你的呀", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1788164833, "tpid": 0, "topic_misc_var": {"2": 47206901}, "__ST": {"fid": 510567, "tid": 47206901, "topic_misc": null, "subject": false, "locked": 0, "recommend": 0, "quote_to": null, "quote_from": 0, "type": 33792, "replies": 9, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "lastpost": 1788161278, "jdata": "{\"sto\": 47212166}", "author": "zeg", "lastposter": "用户名都被占了", "digest": 0, "lastmodify": 1785639284, "tpid": 0, "__P": {"aid": "a:3:{i:1;i:28;i:2;s:13:\"154.12.38.134\";i:0;i:510567;}", "score": 5, "score_2": 1, "content": "[size=130%][b]浪奔浪流 顺应趋势 技术分析 临时讨论 [color=darkred]勿转时事[/color][/b][/size]", "alterinfo": "", "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "fid": 510567, "userip": "154.12.38.134"}, "recommend": 0, "type": 33792, "authorid": 58, "postdate": 1784343019, "subject": false, "pid": null, "tid": 47206901, "fid": 510567}, "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 28, "fid": 510567, "userip": "154.12.38.134"}}, "post_misc_var": {"content_length": 354